    "original":"\/ tatrotpattyanutpattito 'ṣṭābhiḥ kāraṇaiḥ cittasyotpādo 'nutpādo vā \/ tadyathā indriyaparibhedād viṣayānābhāsam ayanād manasikāravaikalyād apratilabdhād virodhāt prahāṇād nirodhād utpādāc ca \/ etad viparyayād utpādo draṣṭavyaḥ kṣaya eva kāraṇaiḥ \/ tatra ya utpādakāraṇaiś cittasyotpādaḥ sā sacittikā bhūmiḥ \/ yaḥ punar anutpādakāraṇair anutpādaḥ sā 'cittikā bhūmiḥ \/\/",
